# Guitar Tool Project Context & Task Tracker

## Current Goals (All Complete)

- [x] **String Strokes / Hits:** WaveVisualizer RMS impulse animation on pluck.
- [x] **Sound Sensitivity & Detection:** YIN threshold 0.18, silence 0.001, noise gate 0.004.
- [x] **UI/UX & Waves:** Responsive WaveVisualizer, landscape support, Hanning window, 40pt path.
- [x] **±8¢ in-tune threshold:** Changed from ±5Hz (musically inaccurate across fretboard) to ±8 cents. At E2 (82Hz), ±5Hz was ±103¢ — far too wide. 8¢ is pro-tuner standard.
- [x] **YIN detector tuned:** threshold=0.15, maxFreq=1050Hz (covers harmonics), silence=0.001, relaxed fallback +0.08.
- [x] **StabilityFilter tuned:** confidenceThreshold=0.30 (was 0.65, was double-gating), EMA=0.65 (faster lock), maxJumpCents=800 (upstream handles new-string reset).
- [x] **Confidence gate:** useTuner pre-filter 0.12 (was 0.15, more permissive for soft picks).
- [x] **New-string jump:** 120¢→100¢ for faster recognition of adjacent string plucks.
- [x] **signal_detected state:** set immediately when first stable pitch found (banner appears faster).
- [x] **±5Hz tuning window:** In-tune is `|freq - targetFreq| ≤ 5Hz`, not cents-based.
- [x] **Fresh audio — no stale frames:** Stale frame age gate (60ms), new-string jump detection (>120¢ resets StabilityFilter), latest-frame-wins pipeline.
- [x] **Ultra-sensitive:** NOISE_GATE_THRESHOLD 0.004, YIN silence 0.001, StabilityFilter history=2, EMA=0.6.
- [x] **Haptic feedback types:** Success (in_tune), Light (flat/sharp), Soft (listen), Medium (lock-on toggle).
- [x] **Lock-on string wired:** Badge in header, hint text below StringSelector, haptic on toggle.
- [x] **Full claymorphism — zero glass:** ThemeProvider→clay, AppSurface glass removed, MainNavigator glass removed, TunerScreen clay gradient, TuningPicker capo buttons themed, PermissionPrompt mic circle themed, SecurityComplianceModal scrim themed. **Confirmed 0 Tailwind glass/color utilities in codebase.**
- [x] **ErrorBoundary:** Wraps App tree, calls clearStaleCache() on crash reset. Clay styled.
- [x] **Cache cleanup:** src/utils/cacheCleanup.ts — wired into ErrorBoundary + Settings screen.
- [x] **State updates:** 25ms (40fps), frame rate limit 15ms.

## Architecture Notes

- **Monorepo:** apps/mobile + packages/tuner-core + packages/music-core
- **State:** Zustand (useTunerStore) — persists only settings to AsyncStorage
- **Audio pipeline:** expo-audio (native), Web Audio API ScriptProcessor (web fallback)
  - Frame age gate: drops frames >60ms old (kills stale queue after burst plucking)
  - New-string gate: resets StabilityFilter on >120¢ jump (clean lock-on per string)
  - Rate limiter: MIN_FRAME_GAP 15ms
  - No-signal clear: 2 frames
- **Detector:** YIN with parabolic interpolation, pre-allocated yinBuffer, threshold=0.18
- **Theme:** Full claymorphism (clay.ts) — zero blur, opaque surfaces, ambient+specular shadows
  - Light: #F0F2F8 bg, #F7F8FC surface, #7178D4 accent, sm=10/md=18/lg=26 radii
  - Dark: #10131F bg, #171B2C surface, #9298FF accent
- **Navigation:** Floating clay pill tab bar (borderRadius=32, clay shadow, opaque)
- **ErrorBoundary:** Class component, clay-styled recovery UI, clearStaleCache on reset

